#==============================================================================================
#
#   svg_paintable - Painting::SVGPaintable: the paintable of an SVG element inside an <svg>
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Painting/SVGPaintable.cpp (lines 1-82) and SVGPaintable.h: construction,
#       the layout box, the bounds and contribution of a <clipPath> child
#       (https://drafts.csswg.org/css-masking-1/#ClipPathElement), the absolute rect (relative
#       to the nearest <svg> root's chain of containing blocks) and anti-aliasing from
#       shape-rendering.
